     1138   ON CHOOSE OF b-region IN FRAME Dialog-Frame
     1139   DO:
     1140     define buffer buf_regions for ub.regions.
     1141     define variable v-reg-code like ub.regions.reg-code no-undo .
     1142     run ref/regions.w ( input  parParentProc
     1143                       , input  'выбор':U
     1144                       , output v-reg-code
     1145                       ).
     1146     if v-reg-code <> ? then do :
     1147       find first buf_regions no-lock
     1148         where buf_regions.reg-code = v-reg-code
     1149       no-error .
     1150       if not available buf_regions then do:
